cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its derived data, please cite it as below."
title: "Natural variation in Arabidopsis light/dark metabolism tests a carbon-starvation model of plant spaceflight transcriptomes"
abstract: >-
  Tests a gas-transport and photosynthesis model of the OSD-522 spaceflight transcriptome
  against measured light/dark metabolism from Arabidopsis natural variation: the model's
  compound predictions against a three-source darkness reference, a PaintOmics resubmission
  with a measured metabolite layer, pre-registered light/dark gene-set tests on six NASA OSDR
  flight contrasts, and a GC-MS panel power estimate from MetaboLights replicate variance.
type: software
